  "content": "\n\n<p>此模組為 Macaw's Mods 與 Mystic's Biomes 之間增加了相容性。你是否一直夢想建造草莓屋頂……那麼，多虧了這個模組，這已經成為可能！</p>\n<div>\n<p>海沫橋：</p>\n<p><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/1770/532/2026-07-03_15-12-20-png.png\"></p>\n<p>草莓屋頂：</p>\n<p><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/1770/533/2026-07-03_15-02-45-png.png\"></p>\n<div>\n<p>楓樹系列：</p>\n<p><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/1770/534/2026-07-03_15-10-04-png.png\"></p>\n<p>熱帶小徑與籬笆：</p>\n<p><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/1770/535/2026-07-03_15-14-07-png.png\"></p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<section>\n<div>\n<p><strong>必要相依性：</strong></p>\n<p><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/addonslib\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><strong>AddonsLib</strong></a></p>\n<p><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/mystics-biomes\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><strong>Mystic's Biomes</strong></a></p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p><strong>選用相依性：</strong></p>\n<p><strong><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/members/sketch_macaw/projects\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">Macaw's Mods</a></strong></p>\n</div>\n</section>\n</div>\n</div>",
